<table align='CENTER' cellpadding='2' border='1' cellspacing='2' background='http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif'><TR><TD><a HREF="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/newspages/news.php?m=10&y=2002">This Month</A></TD><TD><a HREF="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/newspages/news.php?m=9&y=2002">September-2002</A></TD><TD><a HREF="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/newspages/news.php?m=8&y=2002">August-2002</A></TD></TR><TR><TD><a HREF="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/newspages/news.php?m=7&y=2002">July-2002</A></TD><TD><a HREF="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/newspages/news.php?m=6&y=2002">June-2002</A></TD><TD><a HREF="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/newspages/news.php?m=5&y=2002">May-2002</A></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><CENTER><font size=+2>May, 2002</font><BR></center><BR><TABLE align="center" width="85%" border="0"  margin="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="3"><TR><TD ALIGN="center"><IMG SRC="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/La.jpg"></TD><TD width="40%" VALIGN="center" bgcolor="#000000">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face='Impact'>Just for You</font></TD><TD VALIGN="center" ALIGN="right" bgcolor="#000000"><font size='-1' face='Georgia'>Monday - May 6th 2002</font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD></TR></TABLE><TABLE width="85%" align="CENTER" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.jpg" cellpadding="15" border="3" bordercolor="#000000" margin="0" cellspacing="0"><TR><TD><font face='comic sans ms'>Just thought I'd share a couple reasons why your day didn't suck as bad as you thought :>
<BR>
<CENTER>
<IMG border=0 src="http://www.guild-legerdemain.com/memberfiles/user1/futtyDT.jpg">
<BR>
<IMG border=0 src="http://www.guild-legerdemain.com/memberfiles/user1/koraLD.jpg">
</CENTER></font><BR><font size='-2' face='arial'>------submitted by </font><font size='-1' face='arial'><a href=mailto:Terrenoth@yahoo.com>Terrenoth</a></font></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><TABLE align="center" width="85%" border="0"  margin="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="3"><TR><TD ALIGN="center"><IMG SRC="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/La.jpg"></TD><TD width="40%" VALIGN="center" bgcolor="#000000">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face='Impact'>Overking Bathezid down, Keymarad loot!</font></TD><TD VALIGN="center" ALIGN="right" bgcolor="#000000"><font size='-1' face='Georgia'>Saturday - May 4th 2002</font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD></TR></TABLE><TABLE width="85%" align="CENTER" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.jpg" cellpadding="15" border="3" bordercolor="#000000" margin="0" cellspacing="0"><TR><TD><font face='comic sans ms'>Whoot! :><BR>
It's amazing what can be accomplished by a small group of determined people.<BR>
We showed up in Chardok at 12noon with:<BR>
<TABLE border=1 cellpadding=5 align=center>
<TR><TD>
Embren(60chanter)
</TD><TD>
Keymarad(60cleric)
</TD><TD>
Wuddar(60warrior)
</TD></TR><TR><TD>
Deyna(60bard)
</TD><TD>
Tileren(60druid)
</TD><TD>
Skrambold(60monk)
</TD></TR><TR><TD>
Zzeep(60cleric)
</TD><TD>
Futtal(59warrior)
</TD><TD>
Quila(55ranger)
</TD></TR><TR><TD>
Erryn(54ranger)
</TD><TD>
Joredor(56shaman)
</TD><TD>
Ninden(60rogue)
</TD></TR><TR><TD>
Tienen(60druid)
</TD><TD>
Bubben(55druid)
</TD></TR>
</TABLE>
We weren't all too confident heading in since we had far fewer people available than we'd originally hoped.  We talked about our options, then decided to head in anyhow.  If nothing else, we'd all gain a bit more chardok royals experience.<BR>
Bubben and Tienen had to leave early but we were already at the library by the time they had to go.  They played a large part in getting us that far.  Shortly after they left we AAAALLLLMOST wiped out just after the library before the ~hall of death~.  We accidently tagged the king and all his friends.  Just before we were all toast, Keymarad and Ninden managed to get camped out. It was very touch and go when they logged back in and started rezzing.  Mana was very short and the room was popping.  We BARELY got back into business.<BR>
After a close call like that, some might cut thier losses and head out.  Not us, hehe.  Roughly five hours after we started, there we were killing the Overking himself :>  It was amazing to see everyone working together so well.<BR>
Congrats on your king note, Keymarad!! :><BR>
Shortly after the king died and we took screenshots of our massively huge raiding party...<BR>
<CENTER>
<a href="http://www.guild-legerdemain.com/memberfiles/user1/kingdown_a.jpg" target="king"><img border=0 src="http://www.guild-legerdemain.com/memberfiles/user1/kingdown_b.jpg"></a><BR></CENTER>
We found out what g-flux can do to a raid party =/  Apparently, the g-flux sent us up high enough to agro the mobs in the library that we'd long since passed by.  Yup yup, they were more than thrilled about finding out our location and came running to let us know just how thrilled.<BR>
Trust me folks, we didn't do badly at all :>  It was an amazing accomplishment and I personally had a great time.  I hope that we will continue to do so much with so little as we move forward.  Quality is greater than Quantity.</font><BR><font size='-2' face='arial'>------submitted by </font><font size='-1' face='arial'><a href=mailto:Terrenoth@yahoo.com>Terrenoth</a></font></TD></TR></TABLE><BR>



</font>
